   242	## User preferences
   243	
   244	- when the user clarified: "进入P1这个然后点击右边变成P2，如果有保存的登陆状态，直接选择即可，对于左边也同理" -> model P1 as an explicit personal/organization chooser and P2 as the selected branch's symmetric authentication/session state [Task 1]
